    "title" : "12 Sir Lincoln Dr Kumeu, Auckland - Niseko Real Estate Photographer ",
    "sourceUrl" : "",
    "body" : "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" data-updated-on=\"1730790436918\" id=\"item-6729bdc6a616ba49353fe54e\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-358cebc42753a3d203ae\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>About us:</strong> </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Property Media Japan specializes in Real Estate Photography, Videography, Aerial Photography, Floorplans and Virtual Staging. Previously based in Queenstown New Zealand, we are now operating in Niseko, Hokkaido Japan. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Four Comfortable Bedrooms:</strong> Each bedroom is designed as a serene retreat, featuring abundant natural light and quality finishes for maximum comfort.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Two Modern Bathrooms:</strong> Thoughtfully designed with sleek fixtures and ample space, these bathrooms offer style and functionality.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Open Living Area:</strong> The heart of this home is a bright, open living room where large windows invite sunlight and capture scenic views of the surrounding greenery, perfect for family gatherings or relaxation.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Contemporary Kitchen:</strong> Fully equipped with modern appliances, ample cabinetry, and a spacious layout that simplifies meal prep and entertaining.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Single-Car Garage:</strong> Secure parking and additional storage space make this garage convenient for daily living.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Inviting Outdoor Space:</strong> The backyard provides an ideal setup for outdoor entertaining, relaxation, or family activities, surrounded by lush landscaping and a sense of privacy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Located in a charming neighborhood close to Kumeu\u2019s local amenities, schools, and scenic parks, 12 Sir Lincoln Drive offers a unique blend of modern comforts and a peaceful setting. Embrace the best of New Zealand living with this inviting property, designed for both elegance and easy family living. </p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block gallery-block sqs-block-gallery\" data-block-json=\"&#123;&quot;existingGallery&quot;:null,&quot;hSize&quot;:null,&quot;newWindow&quot;:false,&quot;floatDir&quot;:null,&quot;methodOption&quot;:&quot;transient&quot;,&quot;aspectRatio&quot;:null,&quot;auto-crop&quot;:true,&quot;blockAnimation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;collectionId&quot;:&quot;6729be94de3abe3de701adee&quot;,&quot;design&quot;:&quot;stacked&quot;,&quot;show-meta&quot;:true,&quot;show-meta-basic&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-title&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-description&quot;:false,&quot;square-thumbs&quot;:true,&quot;vSize&quot;:null,&quot;transientGalleryId&quot;:&quot;6729be94de3abe3de701adee&quot;&#125;\" data-block-type=\"8\" data-sqsp-block=\"gallery\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1730782483469_169622\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n<div class=\"\n  sqs-gallery-container\n  sqs-gallery-block-stacked\n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n  \n\n  \n  block-animation-none\n  clear\"\n  \n  \n>\n  <div class=\"sqs-gallery\">\n    \n      \n        \n          <div class=\"image-wrapper\" id=\"6729bee50a1e8f073434e3f7\" data-type=\"image\" data-animation-role=\"image\">\n            \n              <noscript><i